# containers to run as root to write into the mounted GITHUB_WORKSPACE, so a non-root USER
# cannot be added (see https://docs.github.com/en/actions/reference/workflows-and-actions/dockerfile-support).
# Same reasoning as the CKV_DOCKER_3 checkov:skip comment in the Dockerfile.
